 "benefits": [
  {
   "text": "REAL-LIFE LOCATION | Nestled between pristine beaches, world-class golf courses and exclusive wellness clubs, EraResidence offers a rare balance of seclusion and seamless access to the finest Mediterraneanlifestyle. | DESIGNED AS A COMMUNITY,NOT A COMPLEX",
   "imgs": [
    "6a150affaf1d8cc969d57dd0_img_cam_02-p-1600.webp"
   ],
   "cls": "benefits-cms_list_item w-dyn-item"
  },
  {
   "text": "Built to stayBuilt to stayDrawing on the spirit of Marbella's golden age, the design blends modern architecture with natural materials, lush landscaping and thoughtfully crafted spaces.Designed as a community, not a complex",
   "imgs": [
    "6a150bbc2a39862be04f2cd5_era-residence-terrace-p-1600.webp"
   ],
   "cls": "benefits-cms_list_item w-dyn-item"
  },
  {
   "text": "Boutique conceptBoutique conceptA boutique gated community of 25 residences on Costa del Sol, designed around privacy, wellbeing and timeless Mediterranean living.Designed as a community, not a complex",
